    "Unizen's Safe upgraded its Polygon, Avalanche, BSC, Arbitrum and Base proxies to the same release about 20 minutes after Ethereum and rolled all back together; Polygon (one tx draining 127 holders) and Avalanche (six txs) were drained after the Ethereum anchor, BSC, Arbitrum and Base not.",
